Hi Sofie, thanks for catching this. For UN 1263 the driver needs the signed d=
angerous goods declaration (DGD) with UN number, class, packing group and qua=
ntity. Was the DGD created in SAP but just not printed, or was it never creat=
ed? I assume the gate check should have stopped it, so my first thought is to=
 add a check at the gate. Please confirm how the trucks are handled today.

Regards,
